==============================================================================================================
C. Contrast per watt per shire, steady (mK per W per shire; difference image unless "state")
==============================================================================================================
Contrast = mean over the pattern's pairs of (ROI of an active shire - mean ROI of its reference shires).
For a commutated pattern the difference image (state A - state B) has twice one state's contrast.
